@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### JSON5：沿用原生运行、Run All 与 Convert to cURL and Copy
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  // 用户名称；可直接临时注释整个参数
  name: '张三',
  // age: 28,

  /* 数字不会经过 double，避免大整数和金额精度丢失 */
  id: 900719925474099312345,
  amount: .1234567890123456789,
  limit: 0xff,
  ratio: 1e-3,
  tags: ['测试', '演示',],
  homepage: 'https://example.com/a//b',
}

### 标准 JSON 继续原样发送
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "李四",
  "active": true
}

### 非 JSON 请求沿用原生处理
POST {{baseUrl}}/echo
Content-Type: text/plain

This is plain text. // This stays in the request body.
